$0.0001 par value per share (the &#147;<B><I>Common Stock</I></B>&#148;) issuable upon conversion of the Shares (the &#147;<B><I>Registrable Securities</I></B>&#148;), under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the &#147;<B><I>Securities
