<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Attached hereto as <B>Exhibit A</B> is a true, correct and complete copy of the resolutions duly adopted by the
