<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Attached hereto as <B>Exhibit B</B> is a true, correct and complete copy of the Certificate of Incorporation of the
Company, together with any and all amendments thereto currently in effect, including the Certificate of Designation, and no action has been taken to further amend, modify or repeal such Certificate of Incorporation, the same being in full force and
effect in the attached form as of the date hereof </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Attached hereto as <B>Exhibit C</B> is a true, correct and
