</TABLE></DIV> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">I, [&#9679;], Chief Executive Officer, hereby certify that [&#9679;] is the duly elected, qualified and
acting Secretary of the Company and that the signature set forth above is [his]/[her] true signature. </P> <P STYLE="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P><DIV ALIGN="right">
